        "content": "## Attack description\n\nAn adversary may execute a flooding attack using the HTTP protocol with the intent to deny legitimate users access to a service by consuming resources at the application layer such as web services and their infrastructure. These attacks use legitimate session-based HTTP GET requests designed to have large amounts of a server's resources. Since these are legitimate sessions this attack is very difficult to detect.\n\n## Prerequisites",
